{"author":{"id":"585844baa6074d44d241f46aa7c9f21ff46653adf617d7f070fbfe327626c989"},"ops":[{"type":3,"timestamp":1795215470,"nonce":"q939eADAjTEWCV2fhqRbD3XMSOI=","message":"Done in a799a52, all three items:\n\n1. Edge diffs: removed targets are deleted and new ones upserted against the stored `_hxn_links`; an unchanged edge keeps the revision that created it (unit test asserts 1 created/0 updated/0 deleted after adding one target, 0/0/1 after dropping one, via DeltaStats).\n2. Field-level snapshots: `Knowledge.captureFields(value, [\"goal\"])` reads the identity and the named Haxe fields; the spatial field and its world relation are selected together; compile errors for unknown, identity, unannotated, empty, duplicate and non-literal selections. A partial snapshot carries `fields` (selected fact/relation names) and empty link lists for unselected relations. A batch carrying one is format version 2; complete-only batches serialize byte-identically to version 1, so stored replay digests are unchanged and version-1-only sinks reject version 2. First publication and restoration after a tombstone must be complete; KnowledgeBatch merges a partial into an earlier snapshot of the same entity and rejects one after its tombstone; MemoryKnowledgeSink and the adapter update only the selected facts/relations/bounds and keep stored provenance when none is given.\n3. Owner/link lookup: one query per semantic type per batch (chunks of 64 keys) instead of one per entity. An in-memory cache was not used, since application Cypher queries could change the graph behind it. The query ORs scalar parameters because KyuGraph 0.4 matches no rows for `IN`/`UNWIND` over a list parameter against delta-written values (filed in the local KyuGraph tracker as 5c51558; named relationship variables returning no rows filed as 0990253).\n\nVerification on macOS: cargo test (6 new adapter tests) and clippy -D warnings for scalar and JIT builds separately; tests/knowledge/run.py --adapter (new partial diagnostics, in-batch coalescing, example revisions 6 and 7 as partial updates, eval vs Ash/full-DCE wire values, KyuGraph replay/restart); the installed-shape KnowledgeGraph check through hxn 0.3.10 check for scalar and JIT on Ash hybrid, JIT and interpreter, hxcpp and CPPIA. Not run: browser (Ash wasm, Emscripten), mobile, Linux and Windows; CI covers browser, Linux and Windows on push.","files":null}]}